reagent-name-ling-neurotoxin = Neurotoxin
reagent-desc-ling-neurotoxin = A highly potent precursor toxin, metabolised in the body into further toxic by products.

reagent-name-muscotoxin = Muscotoxin
reagent-desc-muscotoxin = A potent muscle relaxant, metabolised further into Tetradotoxin.

reagent-name-tetradotoxin = Tetradotoxin
reagent-desc-tetradotoxin = A potent neurotoxin, acts by inhibiting sodium channels in nerve cells.

reagent-name-berserktoxin = Berserk Toxin
reagent-desc-berserktoxin = A neurotoxin that activates the rage associated parts of the brain causing uncontrollable anger

